1
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,718
杰里米：眼下冬奥会正在意大利举行
JEREMY: So, the Winter Olympics
are being held in Italy

2
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:15,112
不过瞧瞧那地方，未免有点太暖和了
which, when you look at the place,
seems to be a bit too warm.

3
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,590
所以我们来到了挪威
That's why we're in Norway.

4
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,318
一个货真价实的冰雪之国
A proper winter country.

5
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:30,592
而且我们还为大家准备了些货真价实的冬季运动
And we've got some proper winter sports
lined up for you.

6
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:34,879
那么欢迎收看
《Top Gear》冬季奥运会！
So welcome, then,
to the Top Gear Winter Olympics.

7
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:46,510
这就是提速暴走版的冬奥会
It's the Winter Olympics speeded up a bit

8
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,194
好了，我们先从冬季两项开始
Right. we'll begin with the biathlon.

9
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:02,114
按常理，这项目是滑雪加射击
Now, normally, this is a combination
of skiing and shooting.

10
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:05,795
但既然这是《Top Gear》
我们就玩飙车加射击
But since this is 70 Gear,
we'll be driving and shooting.

11
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:09,760
詹姆斯：首先来见见参赛选手
JAMES: Let's start
by meeting the contestants.

12
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,433
我用的座驾是这台——
I shall be using this.

13
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,557
全新奥迪Q7
The new Audi Q7.

14
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:21,958
奥迪进军“接送小孩专用四驱车”领域的试水之作
Audi's first attempt
to make a school run 4x4.

15
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:30,756
你看，Q7大致是基于保时捷卡宴打造的
You see, the Q7 is based loosely
on the Porsche Cayenne,

16
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:34,310
但把所有真正硬核的越野装备全给抠掉了
but with all the really hardcore,
off-road stuff taken out.

17
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:37,279
所以这感觉就像你脚上的大笨雪地靴……
So it's a bit like having your big snow boots

18
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:39,431
居然是Jimmy Choo那帮搞时尚的家伙设计的
made by that Jimmy Choo's bloke.

19
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:45,960
它比路虎发现整整长了三英寸
It's a full three inches longer
than a Land Rover Discovery

20
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:49,396
而且比山怪还要丑上整整3%
and it's a full 3% uglier than a troll.

21
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:51,790
不过它也是有优点的
But there are some good things about it.

22
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:55,919
它有一台非常、非常优秀的
3.0升V6柴油发动机
It has a very, very good
V6 3-litre diesel engine,

23
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:00,710
极佳的变速箱
最重要的是，它有七个座
an excellent gear box
and, most importantly, it has seven seats.

24
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:05,030
<i>至于这台3.0升柴油SE版的价格？</i>
<i>And the price for this, the 3-litre diesel SE?</i>

25
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:07,874
刚好不到四万英镑
Just under £40,000.

26
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,355
挺不错的
Very good.

27
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:15,229
家用伪越野车里的第二名
The second sort of
semi off-roader for families.

28
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:17,072
但当老二有什么意思？
But what's the point of being second?

29
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:19,470
这就好比开着巴兹·奥尔德林到处晃
That's like driving around in Buzz Aldrin.

30
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:22,552
我可更想拥有尼尔·阿姆斯特朗
I'd much rather have Neil Armstrong.

31
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:28,871
所以它来了，伴我争夺奥运金牌的座驾
So here he is. The car I'll be using
as I bid for Olympic gold.

32
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:32,232
沃尔沃XC90
It's the Volvo XC90.

33
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:35,630
这是第一款真正由养过孩子的人
This was the first seven-seat 4x4

34
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:37,757
设计出来的七座四驱车
designed by someone who had children.

35
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,958
而不是那种只在书本里见过小孩的工程师
Not by an engineer who had
read about them in a book.

36
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:46,195
这车棒极了，真的
It's a brilliant car. Really is.

37
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:49,318
既不显大妈气，也不招人讨厌
It's not mumsy. It's not gittish.

38
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:54,594
它就像家里的宠物
宛如一只忠诚的老拉布拉多
It's like the family pet.
It's like having a faithful, old Labrador.

39
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,394
不仅如此
There's more, too.

40
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:59,199
它还换装了一台运转平顺的全新柴油机
It's got a smooth, new diesel engine,

41
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:03,592
<i>它空间比奥迪大，
而且还便宜了整整四千英镑。</i>
<i>it's more spacious than the Audi
and it's £4,000 cheaper.</i>

42
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:08,037
那么，到底谁更强？
So, which is best?

43
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,836
是这只“拉布拉多”，还是“巴兹·奥尔德林”？
The Labrador or Buzz Aldrin?

44
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:14,231
好吧，我们就要在接下来的
冬季两项挑战赛里见分晓了。
Well, that's what we're going to find out
in our biathlon.

45
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:16,790
规则非常简单。
The rules are very simple.

46
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:19,076
开着车绕赛道跑三公里，
You drive three kilometres
around the course,

47
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:21,310
停车，射击五个靶子，
stop, shoot at five targets,

48
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:24,199
脱靶一发，罚时五秒。
and there's a five second time penalty
for every miss.

49
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:27,079
没错。接着我们在另一条赛道上再跑三公里，
Yeah. Then we do another three kilometres
on another course,

50
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:29,515
回到这里再次射击，
come back here, shoot at the targets again,

51
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,830
这次得趴在汽车后备箱里打，
this time lying down
in the back of the cars,

52
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,672
然后全力冲向终点。
then it's a sprint to the finish.

53
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:36,320
胜者——也就是我——能拿金牌，
The winner, that will be me, gets gold

54
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:39,756
而输家嘛，
就得去尝尝“黄雪”的滋味了。
and the loser
gets to eat some golden snow.

55
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,840
冲啊！
Come on!

56
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:53,155
杰里米：詹姆斯开着马力更足的奥迪，抢先确立了优势。
JEREMY: James grabbed an early lead
in his more powerful Audi.

57
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,555
哇噢！
Whoa!

58
00:03:57,440 --> 00:04:00,159
而在我急着去追赶他时……
And in my enthusiasm to catch him up...

59
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:02,030
有树！
Trees!

60
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,309
噢，（哔——）。
Oh (BLEEP).

61
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,992
哎呀，我可太爱冬奥会了。
Oh, I love the Winter Olympics, me.

62
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:13,596
杰里米：他当然爱了，因为“龟速船长”此刻已经遥遥领先。
JEREMY: He would because Captain Slow
was now well ahead.

63
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,950
我可不想去啃黄雪。
I don't want to eat golden snow.

64
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,510
太颠簸了。
It's bumpy.

65
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:32,956
冬两运动员每天要摄入
六千卡路里。整整六千大卡！
Biathletes, they need to eat
6,000 calories a day. 6,000!

66
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,919
那相当于两磅黄油、
That's the equivalent
of two pounds of butter,

67
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:39,795
70片面包、112个鸡蛋、
70 slices of bread, 112 eggs,

68
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:43,714
86盒酸奶、28个土豆、
86 tubs of yogurt, 28 potatoes,

69
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:48,516
117块饼干，外加21根特趣巧克力棒。
117 biscuits and 21 Twix bars.

70
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,954
<i>照这么看，
我也能当个奥运冬两选手了。</i>
<i>On that basis,
I could be an Olympic biathlete.</i>

71
00:04:56,560 --> 00:05:00,793
拜我冲出赛道所赐，
詹姆斯已经先到了射击靶场。
Thanks to my off, James had
already arrived at the shooting ranges.

72
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:05,670
弹匣装填。
Magazine in.

73
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,671
听着，正经的冬两运动员赶到这儿时，
Now, your real biathlete arrives here

74
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:10,513
心率大概能飙到
每分钟180次左右。
with his heart doing
about 180 beats per minute.

75
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:14,355
他必须精确配合心跳和呼吸节奏来扣动扳机。
And he has to time this with his heartbeat
and his breathing.

76
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,037
靶场到了。
Shooting range.

77
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,833
五发全中，有本事来超我啊，沃尔沃男。
Five out of five to beat, Volvo man.

78
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:33,629
我才不在乎他打了几环，
I don't care about his score

79
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:37,839
因为他不仅车开得不对，
连枪都用错了。
because not only is he using the wrong car,
he's using the wrong gun.

80
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,871
.22小口径你九岁玩玩还行，
.22 is all right when you're nine,

81
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,917
但赶时间的时候，
你就需要这玩意儿了。
but when you're in a hurry,
you need one of these.

82
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:45,436
一把黑克勒-科赫MP5冲锋手枪。
A Heckler & Koch MP5 machine pistol.

83
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:48,313
好了，全自动射击。
Okay. Fully automatic.

84
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:51,230
吃枪子儿吧，奥运靶子！
Eat lead, Olympic target!

85
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,670
噢，爽。
Oh, yeah.

86
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:06,114
令人震惊的是，我居然全脱靶了。
Staggeringly, I'd missed the lot.

87
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:09,397
所以每脱靶一个就要罚时五秒。
So that was a five second penalty
for each one.

88
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:13,152
噢，被罚25秒简直跟过了一个世纪一样长！
Oh, 25 seconds is a week!

89
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,476
甩尾甩得漂亮。降一挡。
Nice and sideways there. Drop it down one.

90
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,630
行，我现在落后“慢船船长”
大概一分钟。
Okay, I'm about a minute
behind Captain Slow.

91
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:27,314
得把时间抢回来。动力，冲啊！
There's a lot of time to be made up. Power!

92
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:28,874
嗷呜！起飞了！
Yow! Airborne!

93
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,760
柴油车嘛，
越野性能自然极其出色。
Diesel, of course,
is excellent for off-roading.

94
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:36,070
<i>正如我们现在展示的，
我一把将方向盘狠狠打死。</i>
<i>As we're demonstrating now
when I turn this one in really tight.</i>

95
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,992
狠给一脚大油门。
Give it a bit of boot.

96
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,839
环保人士总说
Environmentalists say

97
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:44,719
要是墨西哥湾暖流停止，
英国就会变成这副鬼样子。
that when the Gulf Stream stops,
Britain will look like this.

98
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,949
放马过来吧！
Bring it on!

99
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:51,390
詹姆斯：克拉克森连影子都见不着，
我已经回到了靶场。
JAMES: With Clarkson nowhere in sight,
I arrived back at the rifle range.

100
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:55,235
而这次，我们得从车内
趴着完成射击，
And this time, we had to fire lying down
from inside the car,

101
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:57,470
这意味着得把后排座椅放倒。
which meant dropping the rear seats.

102
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:03,674
行。拔出头枕，放平。
Right. Headrest out, down.

103
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,510
搞定。
That's it.

104
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,796
在Q7里，这简直小菜一碟。
In the Q7, it was a doddle.

105
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:10,315
<i>按下这个。妥了。</i>
<i>I press that. That's it.</i>

106
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,515
注意隐蔽。
Take cover.

107
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,195
来吧！
Come on!

108
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:25,398
见鬼。脱靶了两个。
Oh, cock. I've missed a couple.

109
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,949
杰里米：喂，梅！
你挡在大马路正中间了！
JEREMY: Oh, May!
You're in the middle of the road!

110
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,712
（喇叭长鸣）
(HORN HONKING)

111
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:33,915
（轻笑）
(CHUCKLING)

112
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,433
别按你那破喇叭了。
Stop beeping your horn.

113
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:40,990
-杰里米：你脱靶了吗？
-脱了。
-JEREMY: Have you missed any?
-Yeah.

114
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:43,276
很好，他要被罚时了。好嘞。
Good, he's in the penalty bin. Right.

115
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,873
放倒座椅。
Seats down.

116
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,872
不过好在
Now, the good thing is

117
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:51,559
<i>其实我家车库里就有一辆同款车。</i>
<i>I actually have one of these cars at home.</i>

118
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,633
呃，这玩意儿到底怎么放下去来着？
Well, how does that go down?

119
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,713
不对，不是这个。
That's not it.

120
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,755
（使劲哼哧声）
(GRUNTING)

121
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:03,160
我搞不定了。
I'm stuck.

122
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,951
<i>我怎么可能不知道怎么弄？</i>
<i>How can I not know?</i>

123
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,031
我得给我老婆打个电话。
I'm gonna have to phone my wife.

124
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:10,200
喂，亲爱的……
Hi, darling...

125
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:12,436
<i>不，我知道，我拉了把手了。</i>
<i>No, I know. I pulled the handle.</i>

126
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,434
哦，拉哪个？
Oh, the what?

127
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:16,272
行，谢了。哈！
Okay, thanks. Aha!

128
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,680
给我下去吧。
Go on.

129
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:19,398
这下够平了。
It's flat enough.

130
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,830
把这个压下去。搞定。
Lower that. There we go.

131
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:24,591
当然了，杰里米枪法最绝的地方在于，
Of course, the great thing about
Jeremy's shooting is

132
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:29,277
只要你直接站在靶子正前方，
那就是绝对安全的。
that you are perfectly safe just as long
as you stand right in front of the target.

133
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:33,035
杰里米：其实我已经吸取教训了，
这次我绝对不会脱靶。
JEREMY: Actually, I'd learnt my lesson
and I wasn't gonna miss this time.

134
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:54,914
<i>于是，就在詹姆斯一路狂飙时，
我又回到了罚时区。</i>
<i>So with James thundering along,
I was back in the penalty box.</i>

135
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,719
就算是史提夫·汪达闭着眼打都比这准。
Stevie Wonder could have done better.

136
00:08:58,520 --> 00:08:59,840
稍微飞起来了。
A bit of air.

137
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,839
这也……
That's...

138
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:04,433
太精彩了。
That's excellent.

139
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:08,829
但紧接着詹姆斯就不狂飙了，
改成了疯狂撞车。
But then James stopped
thundering and started crashing.

140
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,310
天哪。
God.

141
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:12,715
我的天。
God.

142
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:15,155
男子：（电台通话）詹姆斯冲出去了！
詹姆斯冲出去了！
MAN: (ON RADIO) James is off!
James is off!

143
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:17,072
詹姆斯出去了？太棒了！
James is off? Yes!

144
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:19,834
<i>我是说，糟糕。哦不。</i>
<i>I mean, no. Oh, no.</i>

145
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:22,191
哎呀，可怜的詹姆斯。
Oh, poor James.

146
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:35,638
还从没有哪辆沃尔沃
被开得这么狂暴过。
Never has a Volvo
been driven like this before.

147
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:40,716
-是他。
-是詹姆斯。
-That's him.
-That's James.

148
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,632
<i>加把劲，我能追上他！</i>
<i>Come on, I can catch him!</i>

149
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,679
滚一边去，克拉克森！
Sod off, Clarkson!

150
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:57,878
快到终点了，
我们几乎并驾齐驱。
We are neck and neck
as we're coming to the finish.

151
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:01,798
不！他要超过去了！
No! He's gonna get ahead!

152
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,789
他在外线，这势头不错。
He's on the outside. This is looking good.

153
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:10,034
哦，失误了。
Oh, that's a mistake.

154
